{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2022-07-20 17:00:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., JULY 20, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE: BRO) ANNOUNCES THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.1025 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON AUGUST 17, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON AUGUST 10, 2022.'}